1
00:03:54,583 --> 00:03:57,270
Just give me one minute
of your precious time.

2
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:01,417
"Precious time"? [laughs mockingly]

3
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:04,170
-Yeah, just give me one minute.
-[sighs]

4
00:04:04,250 --> 00:04:06,708
You would have one more minute,
wouldn't you?

5
00:04:08,346 --> 00:04:11,583
Okay, half. Half a minute.

6
00:04:14,208 --> 00:04:17,917
-[gulls calling]
-[ocean waves crashing faintly]

7
00:04:22,333 --> 00:04:24,008
[sighs]

8
00:04:25,471 --> 00:04:29,375
I knew it. I knew it.

9
00:04:30,250 --> 00:04:32,583
You will not regret this.
